---
title: GHOST — permissions
---
%% Intended design; not runtime evidence
flowchart TD
  Launch["Launch"] --> Local["Ordinary OS user; no account sign-in"]
  Local --> CameraOff["Camera off"]
  CameraOff --> Enable{"User enables camera?"}
  Enable -->|No| Shortcut["Full shortcut and mouse path"]
  Enable -->|Yes| Privacy{"Windows camera access available?"}
  Privacy -->|No| Denied["Explain privacy or busy state"]
  Denied --> Shortcut
  Privacy -->|Yes| Indicator["Local inference with visible indicator"]
  Indicator --> Stop["Pause or disable releases camera"]
  Local --> Capture{"Explicit foreground capture?"}
  Capture -->|Yes| Preview["Volatile selection and preview"]
  Preview --> Confirm{"Confirm crop storage?"}
  Confirm -->|Yes| Store[("User-local selected crop")]
  Confirm -->|No| Discard["Discard"]
  Local --> External{"External controls opt-in?"}
  External -->|No| Disabled["External automation disabled"]
  External -->|Yes| Validate{"Tested allowlist and safe identity?"}
  Validate -->|No| Unsupported["Unavailable; no fallback injection"]
  Validate -->|Yes| Deliberate["Deliberate action then revalidate"]
